  "id": "a-note-from-mydei",
  "name": "A Note from Mydei",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/A_Note_from_Mydei",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-12T09:01:05.289Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To (Trailblazer):"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I yearn to clash with you in the heavens above, yet I must still bear the duty that lies beneath,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "for even when the flames of war subside, someone must lead the way to peace."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Words cannot express my gratitude for your salvation,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "and I'd only raise this cup of crimson pomegranate honey brew,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "to toast to our victory in this life, and our journey through the stars."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Your expedition will be surrounded by wolves and lurking vipers."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If you need the flames of Strife, I shall offer you my Kremnos, along with my blood and bones."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "They'll accompany your conquest and aid in your endless victories."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "When you return triumphant, I shall raise my glass to you once again."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Mydeimos"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
